A '''scrapyard''' was located on the [[planet]] [[At Attin]] during the [[New Republic Era]].<ref name="Real Adventure" /> By [[9 ABY]],<ref name="SCDate">{{SkeletonCrewDate}}</ref> the [[human]] [[Fern]] and her friend [[KB]] had visited the scrapyard.<ref name="Real Adventure" /> That [[Standard year|year]],<ref name="SCDate" /> when KB discovered that the pair needed a new [[power converter]] for [[Fern and KB's hoverbike|their hoverbike]], Fern commented that the scrapyard had been picked over, implying that they were not going to find a new power converter there.<ref name="Real Adventure" />

==Behind the scenes==
The scrapyard was mentioned in "[[This Could Be a Real Adventure]],"<ref name="Real Adventure" /> the first episode of the live-action [[Disney+]] series ''[[Star Wars: Skeleton Crew]]'', which aired on [[December 2]], [[2024]].<ref name="Early">{{SW|url=news/skeleton-crew-premiere-date|text=''Star Wars: Skeleton Crew'' Will Debut Early|date=2024-11-26}}</ref>

